aura-launcher (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Autostart support via install.sh --autostart
  * Opt-in wlr-layer-shell support (AURA_LAYER_SHELL=1)
  * Cross-desktop documentation for shortcuts and tiling window managers
  * --version now answers locally even when a background instance runs

